# Claude Code worktree isolation. Created automatically when a session runs
# EnterWorktree with its working directory inside this repo. Local scratch only —
# it holds a duplicate copy of every prototype and must never be committed,
# because pages.yml publishes this whole directory (path: .) to public GitHub Pages.
.claude/

# Temp render targets. Agents render a prototype here first and only move it over
# the live file once it is complete and syntax-checked, so an interrupted write
# cannot destroy a working prototype.
*.new.html

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
